{
  "bodyHash": "oualmV3oYss=",
  "content": "<p><em><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/ip_banner.gif\" alt=\"\"></em></p><h2><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">物品欄寵物</span></span></span></strong></em></h2><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">你是否厭倦了那些總是輕易死亡、不聽指令的脆弱寵物？</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">想要在你的遊戲世界中增添超酷的樂趣和新能力嗎？</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">在尋找那些會與你同甘共苦、超級可愛（且往往致命）的夥伴嗎？</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through;color:#999\">是否曾夢想讓一群綿羊在汪洋大海上跳起噴泉舞？</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#999\">如果你對以上任何問題回答「是」，那真是太棒了。但我們在這裡是要介紹「物品欄寵物」，而不是提問。</span></p><h4><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-size:14pt\">什麼是物品欄寵物？<br></span></em></strong>物品欄寵物是存在於你物品欄中的活躍動態生物，牠們會透過照顧與餵食，為你帶來驚人的特殊效果、掉落物、增益、實用功能、防禦和武器。此外，有些寵物（例如「紫晶奶牛」）特別英俊。目前共有<strong>69</strong>種獨特且令人驚嘆的寵物，各自擁有令人眼花繚亂的技能與華麗技巧。</span></h4><p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><em><strong>寵物如何運作？</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\">物品欄寵物擁有獨特而強大的能力，當牠們位於你的物品欄快捷欄時，這些能力會生效。如果將寵物移出快捷欄或未及時餵食，效果將會消失。真是個糟糕的主人！</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14pt\">如何獲得物品欄寵物？<br></span></strong>物品欄寵物可以透過四種方式獲得：</span></p><ol>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">合成：所有寵物均可使用原版 Minecraft 材料合成。稀有且強大的寵物所需材料更多。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">探索：寵物可在六種地牢中找到：主世界中的海底洞穴、雲端地牢、樹頂地牢和地下地牢，地獄中岩漿湖旁的地獄地牢，以及終界中的太空地牢。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">使用石化器：這是一種特殊的稀有魔杖，只要你的物品欄中有鑽石或地獄之星，就能將許多世界中的物體直接轉化為寵物。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">使用元寵物：在工作台中組合 3 到 4 隻寵物以創造元寵物。使用相同類別的寵物組合，將獲得該類別的元寵物。組合的寵物越「稀有」，獲得特殊或傳說級寵物的機率越高。</span></li>\n</ol><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><br>請注意，最新的 1.18.2、1.19.2 和 1.20.1 版本需要 Curios API</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><em><strong>模組評價</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JNTlKZu7rV4\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hg_uMayAjfA\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gauUe00SUs8\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><strong>寵物命名器<br></strong></span>只需手持任意寵物時按下「N」鍵，即可為其命名。無需任何經驗值！</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/petnamer.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><strong><br>飼料袋<br></strong></span>將所有寵物食物存放在一個袋子中，並可將袋子放在你的（原版）物品欄任意位置。你的寵物會自行尋找食物並直接從中進食。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/feed-bag-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><strong><br>合成配方說明<br></strong></span>以下以苦力怕為例：外圍放置綠寶石碎片，頂部中央放置其最愛的食物（火藥），中央放置鑽石，底部放置金錠。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/creeper-recipe.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\">大多數寵物遵循上述合成結構。每隻寵物（傳說級除外）的所需材料已列在各自寵物的介紹中。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/blank-recipe.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">O = 外層</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">F = 食物</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">D = 鑽石（通常）</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">G = 金錠</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><strong>合成配方<br></strong></span>以下列出大多數配方。我們建議在遊戲中使用 JEI 模組來查詢合成配方。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14pt;color:#999\"><strong>怪物寵物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/creeper-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>苦力怕</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/enderman-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>終界使者</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/ghast-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>地獄幽靈</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/iron-golem-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>鐵巨人</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/magma-cube-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>岩漿立方怪</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/snow-golem-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>雪人</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/spider-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>蜘蛛</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/wither-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>凋零怪</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/blaze-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>烈焰使者</strong><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><strong><br>和平寵物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/chicken-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>雞</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/cow-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>牛</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/ocelot-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>豹貓</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/pig-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>豬</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/sheep-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>羊</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/squid-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>烏賊</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/mooshroom-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>蘑菇牛</strong><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><strong>實用寵物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/anvil-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>鐵砧</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/bed-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>床</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/brewing-stand-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>釀造台</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/chest-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>儲物箱</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/crafting-table-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>工作台</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/double-chest-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>大型儲物箱</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/enchant-table-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>附魔台</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/furnace-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>熔爐</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/jukebox-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>唱片機</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/nether-portal-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>地獄傳送門</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/ender-chest-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>終界箱</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><strong>特殊寵物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/mickerson-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>米克森</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/pingot-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>平果特</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/pc-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>紫牛</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/qcm-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>量子水晶怪獸</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/banana-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>香蕉</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/sponge-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>海綿</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/loot-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>戰利品</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/juggernaut-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>巨獸</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/illuminati-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>光明會</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/grave-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>墳墓</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/quiver-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>箭袋</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><strong>粉絲建議寵物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/pacman-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>小精靈</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/cheetah-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>獵豹</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/house-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>房屋</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/silverfish-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>蠹魚</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/wolf-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>狼</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/apple-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>蘋果</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><strong>節日寵物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/holiday_rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>寵物節寵物</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/april-fool-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>愚人節</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><strong>範圍效果寵物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/shield-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>盾牌</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/heart-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<strong>愛心</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/moon-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<strong>月亮</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/dubstep-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<strong>迴響貝斯</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><strong>傳說寵物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/black-hole-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>黑洞</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/cloud-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>雲朵</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/puffer-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>河豚</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/recipes/slime-rec.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>史萊姆</strong></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"color:#999\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:14pt\"><em><strong>地下城</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/images/ip/ip_dungeons.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999\">在《物品欄寵物》中共有6座地下城，每座都由強化怪物或陷阱守護。每個地下城都有一個寶箱，有極小機率藏有傳說級物品欄寵物。1.21.1版本新增的平果特寵物能協助你定位這些難以捉摸的地下城。</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">天空地下城可在主世界找到，由烈焰使者守護，僅在你靠近寶箱時出現。這是唯一有機會獲得雲朵寵物的地點。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">海底洞穴位於海洋中，由具備水下呼吸能力的洞穴蜘蛛守護。這是唯一有機會找到河豚寵物的地點。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">地下城由快速移動的殭屍守護，是唯一能找到史萊姆寵物的地點。專業提示：使用絲綢之觸挖掘雲朵方塊可獲得透視方塊，讓地下探索更輕鬆。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">樹頂據點出現在普通森林、樺木森林和叢林中，雖無守護者，但有時會生成TNT。這是唯一有機會找到太陽寵物的地點。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">地獄地下城位於地獄的熔岩湖中，由凋零骷髏守衛。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#999\">終界太空城是唯一能找到黑洞寵物的地點，由隱形敵人守護。你需要雲朵寵物或其他飛行手段才能發現它們。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>© Purplicious_Cow 2015-2025</strong>&nbsp;本模組（",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
